  "files": [
    {
      "section": "Clinical Analysis",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 25 trust",
      "description": "Imaging test for this Operator showed blurry outline of internal organs with visible unusual dark spots. Unusually high concentration of Originium particles were present in her circulation, indicating signs of infection and confirming her as infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 5% \nThe infection is consistently spreading. Regular observation and control are required. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.31u/L \nSubject has both visible crystallization and other symptoms of Oripathy. Although her condition is not serious, Angelina must keep to a course of treatment.\n—Medic Operator Warfarin"
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 1",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 50 trust",
      "description": "She may not realize it, but Angelina has a special knack for Arts! She can change how much an object weighs. I think if she gets the proper training, she could be amazing one day!"
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 2",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 100 trust",
      "description": "Having only just recently become a transporter, Angelina is full of hope for the future, much like other high schoolers. She spends much of her time studying or dressing up. \nShe likes dainty jewelry and young adult novels, and hides a secret love for older music. She could enjoy an ordinary, happy life. \n\nWhen Rhodes Island sought her out, she was gliding between skyscrapers in the middle of a dark night."
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 3",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 150 trust",
      "description": "The world is unfair. \nAfter she suffering her infection, Angelina quietly faded from her old life. \nShe didn't linger or say her goodbyes. She just silently left her family, friends, and beloved hometown behind. \nYet she had not resigned herself to the typical fate of an Infected. \nEvery night, she ran, jumped, glided between buildings, practiced her Arts, and smuggled goods from one place to another. \nAs a courier, an Infected, or just a normal high-schooler, Angelina works hard, no matter what the future may look like."
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 4",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 200 trust",
      "description": "Before she came to Rhodes Island and met the Doctor, Angelina kept these secrets hidden away in her heart. \nIt wasn't until Rhodes Island found her that she knew there was another life for the Infected. She is now a Rhodes Island Operator, and she may be able to go back to school. \nProbably. \nWhere will the path Angelina has chosen take her? \nEven she can't imagine."
    }
  ]
